{
  "id": "ACT.25",
  "number": "25",
  "bookId": "ACT",
  "reference": "Tlehhma'Aá Ya/Abuuse 25",
  "verseCount": 27,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "25",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ACT 25"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "25",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Festo iwa baraá ga/awusi'iimár i dáh, deelo tám iwa waaráhh iri Kaisareár wa tsa/án ay Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaahamuusér uren ar Mungú nee bariisér múk Yahudi kángw Paulo nguri dirós i alki/iitiyé'. Nguri harhheehhe'eemisiyé', ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "inooín ngiwa aleeya/án Paulo kunguwa huwi Yerusalemu. Asma inooín Paulo ngun giirór wa slaiyá' kuwa gaasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Festo iri oó', «Paulo ku xún Kaisareár wa ale, nee aniíngú kilá' a amorqí kií/ ar gaanslaay.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iri oó', «Heewí bar gár aa tlakweés i deer, geeraharuuserhúng nee án ti koomaán ay Kaisarea as nguwa sakwasleemuutiya'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Deelo dakaát laqaá mibaangw ngiwa amoodá' wa hhe'eés, iri /eét ay Kaisaréa. Looaytleérós iri iwiít gawaá kitángw sakwasleema, iri oó', «Paulo huwaare'.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paulo iwa hardáh, múk Yahudi oo naa Yerusalemúr wa /eet, nguna harweeriyé', nguri /ayseenaá yaariír i tlaaqiyé'. Ala looeemaawós laqaamaro kaa aleeslayká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paulo iri oó', «Aníng hara'ayár múk Yahudi aga si'iiká, laqaá ar Doó Mungú, laqaá tam ar waawutmoó múk Roma.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala Festo múk Yahudi nguwa ilaá hhó' i tlehhituú wa slai, Paulo guri báy, «Yerusalemu a keéra as tuwa dír geeraeé' wa sakwasleemuuti asma kaangwí?»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paulo iri oó', «Aníng aga sihhiít geeraá kitángw sakwasleema oo waawutmoó múk Roma, nee diirí an dír hariim sakwasleemar'eene. Kuúng a ló'wa xú' adór aníng múk Yahudi gár nguwa sadakuús ir káhh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala án bar ana dakuús, laqaá gár tlaakw ana tleéhh, ar aníng niwa hariim gwa'araro, gwa'ara a siasiaaká. Ala /aymuuwí iwa sakwasleemutiya' bar loeeká, heé aníng i dabaaín i qaás i kaahh. Kwasleemar'eé' i waarahh amór waawutmoó múk Roma.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Festo bariisér kwasleema ngiwa i axweés, Paulo guri báy, «Waarahhamuú amór waawutmoó múk Roma una slá', a daqeér amór waawutmoó múk Roma.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Deelór hhaawaaká iwa waaráhh, waawutmo Agripa nee Bernike nina Kaisareár i hardihiyé', Festo nguna laaw'eesár ayé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Deelór yaariir ngiwa amoodá' wa hhe'eesiyé', Festo kángw Paulo guri alki/iít dír waawutmo, iri oó', «Heeko i deer oo Felisi aa geexáy baraá tseegamo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár niwa Yerusalemúr i dirii', kaahamuusér uren ar Mungú nee bariisér Yahudi, kangós nguna dir'eé' alki/iitiyé', nee gár i slaiya' a kun sakwasleemuut. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngiri báw, ‹Dákw adór kwisíng dír múk Romaro i kaahh, oo hee kuwa haniisi dír mukdá' inós gu sakwasleemuút as kuwa gaasi, bar taa al sihhiitiiká baraá kwasleemaro.› ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín niwa diirí burumburiitiyé', aníng iga tligisiiká, ala looaytleérós ana iwiít gawaá kitángw kwasleema, niri oó', ‹Heesíng huwaare'.› ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukdá' gwa sakwasleemuut iwa sihhiít geeraá kwasleema, án geeraá kah /aymuú tlaákw ngu huwiyá', ala inooín /aymuú tlaákw oo naa ooiyé' i kaahh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala aqo har daanduú diínir'ín nguna kaanganuusiyé', nee daanduú kángw heeko ta bay Yesu, oo aa qaroó gwaa', ala Paulo baraá axweesantose gari gawdeés adór ir slaáf. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng loohír kaangwí sleémeero ngur slaw aga xuuiiká. Gawaá adoorihe Paulo una yaahaás, ‹Yerusalemu a keéra as tuwa sakwasleemuuti amoodá' wa ale?› ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala Paulo gár aa slaá' a waarahhamuú amór waawutmoó múk Roma. Iri firín as kuwa xun ay dír kwasleemarós kay tsati nee Kaisari. Aníng adoodá' ana ya/aám.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agripa Festo guri báy, «Heesíng geeraawo aníng unqo iiárií qaasár wa slaá'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Festo iri oó', «Matlo uqo axás.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Looaytleérós Agripa nee Bernike niri hardihiyé' ar xirif, tari dáh ay didá' kwasleema kawa axamiisi, dinkwa nee geeraharuusér uren ar askaári nee bariisér gixsa. Festo iri oó', «Paulo huwaare'.» Paulo kuri huúw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Festo iri oó', «Waawutmo Agrípa, nee kuungáká' sleémeero diirí diriiá' nee atén. Heewí u ga/eerá'a? Múk Yahudi sleémeero kudá' Yerusalemúr i dirií' nee oo baraakií dirií', i dir'eé' kwasleemuut. Gár ta /aa/amin a gaasarós, asma ta kaahi heewí i harinká iwa slafi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala aníng ana tsaáhh adór gár tlaakw aa tleéhh ir káhh ar gwa'arár wa hariim. Slám inós waarahhamaá amór waawutmoó múk Roma ngiwa firín, aníng ana slaá' nguwa amoorósí huuw. ",
          "type": "text",
