              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee aníng /aymuú kilá' daanduuwose ni amór waawutmoó i gooiim i kaahh. Gawaá adoorihe nguna geeraahúngí huúw, ak alé dír geeraawók, waawutmo Agrípa, as kahhó' bur kwa yaahamiís, án /aymuú daanduúuwose ni gooiim nguwa slaw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.26",
